  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your shell has grown with you through your journey, and the blessings of the great shelled beasts of the world has imbued it with immense power. You can inscribe two runes from the Runic Shell feat at a time, and if your Teratoan Shell would be destroyed, it regrows around you during your next rest and daily preparations. If you have the Teratoan Shield feat, the outer shell regrows in a similar manner if it was ever destroyed with all your attachments and runes intact. If you have the Shellshock feat, you add a +2 circumstance bonus to your Shove attempts.</span></p>"
